  m_text: "The game uses an IMU (Inertial Measurement Unit) to track the player's
    movements. This technology consists of accelerometers, gyroscopes, and magnetometers,
    which measure the player\u2019s orientation, acceleration, and rotation in real
    time. The IMU ensures that every movement is accurately detected and matched
    against the dance poses displayed on the walls."
